--- !u!114 &1625645188
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1625645182}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8b7d59229f4a4104babe756b54654abd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pagerUniqueID: pager
  pagerItemName: pager
  pagerItemType: 1
  pickupHideTarget: {fileID: 1625645182}
  foundDialogues:
  - Your pager. You always bring it with you.
  - Seems there is already a message for you. Play it?
  playRecordingOptionText: Play
  afterPlayRecordingDialogues:
  - '"...Kian, if you can hear this, take a breath first."'
  - It is Amelia! Thanks god!
  - Although you really want to enjoy the sense of peace brought by your lover's
    voice for a little longer, you must focus your attention on listening right now.
  - '"...You may not remember everything.  There was an accident during the portal
    launch.

    No one knows what exactly happened, but the portal seems been used
    and now we don''t have enough enery stone to lanch it again"'
  - "\u201DMeanwhile, we found one person is missing ... that's Jeff.\u201C"
  - '"We didn''t find him in the base.

    And You are the one in a coma for the
    longest time. So we left you in the base."'
  - "\u201D...I know it is a strange thing but, if you wake up, take a rest, then
    come and find us. We are searching for new enery stones outside the base.\u201C"
  - "\u201DWe are still going home.\u201C"
  - ...
  - ...Jeff?
  - Althouth he is your roommate, you could hardly see him, so still now, you don't
    know much about Jeff.
  - Anyway, find some clues about Jeff is the only thing you can do for your team
    right now.
  dialogueAudioSettings:
    bgmOnStart: {fileID: 0}
    bgmOnStartFadeOutDuration: 1
    bgmOnStartFadeInDuration: 1
    bgmOnStartVolume: 1
    bgmOnComplete: {fileID: 0}
